DESCRIPTION:Join FSU Libraries and the Jim Moran College of Entrepreneurship for the inaugural Innovation Book Club! We’re diving into Kara Swisher's Burn Book: A Tech Love Story\, an explosive insider look at Silicon Valley's tech giants. Meet us at the InNolevation Center to discuss the read and enjoy free pizza and drinks.\n\nLink to access the e-book\n\nDates and Times: \n\n9/21 (Chapters 1-6) \n\n10/19 (Chapters 7-11)\n\n11/16 (Chapters 12-16) \n\nAll from 5:00-6:30pm! \n\nLocation: InNolevation Center (Shaw 226)
