DESCRIPTION:This workshop introduces FSU’s institutional repository and explains how graduate students can showcase scholarly works such as articles\, datasets\, dissertations\, conference posters\, and other research. Topics include copyright permissions\, embargo options\, version control\, and long-term visibility of scholarly work.
