DESCRIPTION:Please join us for our Ask A Librarian hours in partnership with the Jim Moran College of Entrepreneurship. Bring your questions about entrepreneurship classes or your small business! Your librarian can help with questions like:\n\nHow can I get access to the New York Times and Wall Street Journal for free through the library?\n\nWhere can I find the historical stock price for Starbucks over the last 10 years?\n\nI'm new to business research. What is the main database I should start with for an intro entrepreneurship class?\n\nI'm writing a report on Target\, where can I find reliable company information and financials?\n\nTime: 3-4 pm on the first and third Tuesday of every month (9/1\, 9/15\, 10/6\, 10/20\, 11/3\, 11/17\, 12/1).\n\nLocation: InNolevation Center (Shaw 226)
GEO:30.443814;-84.293584
LOCATION:Roderick K. Shaw Building (RSB)\, InNOLEvation® Center\, RSB 226
