DESCRIPTION:With the vast amount of statistics and infographics now available at the touch of a finger or click of a mouse\, it is often difficult to determine which ones offer an accurate representation of a topic. This interactive workshop will provide an overview of data literacy and reproducibility concepts\, aimed at giving attendees the knowledge needed to determine the purpose for which statistical and pictorial data is being used and whether conclusions using the data are sound.\n\nRegistration
